<title>RUSSIA: Komi region to sell 0.35 pct Komineft.</title>
<headline>Komi region to sell 0.35 pct Komineft.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Komi Republic Property Fund will auction 0.35 percent of OAO Komineft on March 14, the Russian Federal Property Fund said on Monday.</p>
<p>The stake comprises 203,100 shares with a face value of 1,000 roubles, it said in the latest issue of its Reforma bulletin.</p>
<p>Komineft is mostly owned by OAO Neftyanaya Kompaniya KomiTEK.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
